      "raw_html": "<div class=\"question\" id=\"question-125323\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">10.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/340#750\">Finding the First Few Terms of the Maclaurin Series of a Function</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"125323\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Find the first three non-zero terms of the Maclaurin expansion of the function <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"450\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-msup><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyHard\">H</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 11:49 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:58</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
