"0.167em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>s</mtext><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> Round your final answer to the nearest Newton.</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 11:50 AM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:10</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>",
