    {
      "dom_id": "question-124842",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Given the series $S={\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{{n}^{3}+3\\sqrt{n}}{2{n}^{4}},$ which of the following is true?",
      "worked_solution": "First, we note that $S$ is not a $p$-series, and we know from the $n$th term test the condition $\\frac{{n}^{3}+3\\sqrt{n}}{2{n}^{4}}\\to 0$ as $n\\to \\infty $ as $n\\to \\infty $ does not tell us anything about the convergence or divergence of the series.\n\nThe comparison test for divergence states the following:\n\n*Consider two series ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ and ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}$ such that ${a}_{n}$ and ${b}_{n}$ are both positive and ${a}_{n}\\ge {b}_{n}$ for all $n.$ If ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}$ is divergent, then ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is also divergent.*\n\nWe follow four steps to show that $S$ is divergent.\n\n**Step 1**: First, we let ${a}_{n}=\\frac{{n}^{3}+3\\sqrt{n}}{2{n}^{4}}$ and ${b}_{n}=\\frac{1}{2n}.$ We note that ${a}_{n}>0$ and ${b}_{n}>0$ for all $n\\ge 1.$\n\n**Step 2**: We show that ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}$ is divergent. We have,\n\n$$\n{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{b}_{n}=\\frac{1}{2}{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }\\frac{1}{n}\n$$\n\nwhich is divergent by the $p$-series test.\n\n**Step 3**: We show that ${a}_{n}\\ge {b}_{n}$ for all $n\\ge 1.$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{n} & \\overset{?}{\\ge }{b}_{n} \\\\ \\frac{{n}^{3}+3\\sqrt{n}}{2{n}^{4}} & \\ge \\frac{{n}^{3}}{2{n}^{4}}=\\frac{1}{2n}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n**Step 4**: We conclude that ${\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}$ is divergent by the comparison test.",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-124842\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">52.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/745#7300\">Applying the Comparison Test to Show That a Series Diverges</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"124842\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>Given the series <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1566\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D446 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mstyle space=\"4\"><mjx-munderover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.192em; padding-left: 0.368em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-over><mjx-box><mjx-munder><mjx-row><mjx-base><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-lop\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2211 TEX-S2\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-base></mjx-row><mjx-row><mjx-under style=\"padding-top: 0.167em; padding-left: 0.058em;\"><mjx-texatom size=\"s\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-texatom></mjx-under></mjx-row></mjx-munder></mjx-box></mjx-munderover><mjx-mstyle space=\"2\"><mjx-mfrac><mjx-frac type=\"d\"><mjx-num><mjx-nstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-nstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msqrt><mjx-sqrt><mjx-surd><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c221A\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-surd><mjx-box style=\"padding-top: 0.281em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-box></mjx-sqrt></mjx-msqrt></mjx-mrow></mjx-num><mjx-dbox><mjx-dtable><mjx-line type=\"d\"></mjx-line><mjx-row><mjx-den><mjx-dstrut type=\"d\"></mjx-dstrut><mjx-mrow><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D45B TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.289em;\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c34\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-script></mjx-msup></mjx-mrow></mjx-den></mjx-row></mjx-dtable></mjx-dbox></mjx-frac></mjx-mfrac></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><munderover><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\">∑</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi></munderover><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>,</mo></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> which of the following is true?</p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 1:52 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:38</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>",
