y=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"INNER\"><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"OPEN\">{</mo><mtable columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\" rowspacing=\"0.7em 0.2em\"><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>x</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mi>y</mi><mo data-mjx-alternate=\"1\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr></mtable><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"CLOSE\" fence=\"true\" stretchy=\"true\" symmetric=\"true\"></mo></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nConsider the system of differential equations above. What is the behavior of the system's solutions near the equilibrium <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1595\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-msup><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D431 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2217\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cA0\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.363em;\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D447 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3F\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">x</mi></mrow><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>?</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"questionBody\" id=\"questionBody-337709\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1792\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 2em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"2em\"></mspace></mstyle></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>\nThe equilibrium is an \n<div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-337709-0\" style=\"margin: 0px 4px 2px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame incorrectSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-337709-0\" style=\"width: 156px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\"> <span class=\"selectListSelectedText\"></span></div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">asymptotically stable</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">unstable</div></div></div><div class=\"selectList\" id=\"selectList-337709-1\" style=\"margin: 0px 2px 2px 4px;\"><div class=\"selectListFrame incorrectSelection\" id=\"selectListFrame-337709-1\" style=\"width: 103px; height: 17px; line-height: 17px;\"> <span class=\"selectListSelectedText\"></span></div><div class=\"selectListOptions\" style=\"visibility: hidden; z-index: 1;\"><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">spiral sink</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">spiral source</div><div class=\"selectListOption\" style=\"height: 17px;\">saddle</div></div></div>.</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyEasy\">E</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 1:52 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:01</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: red;\">Incorrect</span></span></div></div>"
