sistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1635\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Use the left Riemann sum, with the four subintervals indicated by the data, to approximate the area under the curve <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1636\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D466 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c3D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> over the interval <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1637\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\" tabindex=\"0\"><mjx-math aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"MJX-TEX\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"2\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c5D\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml display=\"inline\" unselectable=\"on\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div><div class=\"answerDetails\"><div class=\"questionDifficulty difficultyModerate\">M</div><span class=\"answerCreated\">Wed, Oct 14th @ 1:55 PM</span><span class=\"answerDetailsSeparator\">|</span><span class=\"timeElpased\">Elapsed: 0:58</span><span class=\"answerResult\"><span style=\"color: green;\">Correct</span></span></div></div>"
    },
    {
      "dom_id": "question-72064",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "The following table shows the number of customers per minute, $C(t),$ that arrive at a bank, measured over a period of $15$ minutes.\n\n| $t\\,\\text{(minutes)}$ | $0$ | $3$ | $7$ | $12$ | $15$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $C(t)\\,\\text{(customers/minute)}$ | $3$ | $4$ | $3$ | $5$ | $2$ |\n\nUse the right Riemann sum over $[0,15]$ with four subintervals to approximate the total number of customers served.",
      "worked_solution": "Let $A$ denote the area under the curve $y=C(t)$ over $[0,15].$ In this case, we have $n=4$ rectangles. Using the right Riemann sum, the area is approximated as \n\n$$\nA≈C(3)Δ{t}_{1}+C(7)Δ{t}_{2}+C(12)Δ{t}_{3}+C(15)Δ{t}_{4},\n$$\n\nwhere each $Δ{t}_{i}$ is calculated by considering the step between a particular $t$-value and the previous one, i.e.,\n\n$$\nΔ{t}_{i}={t}_{i}-{t}_{i-1}.\n$$\n\nWe set up a value table that includes the $Δt$'s.\n\n| $t$ | $0$ | $3$ | $7$ | $12$ | $15$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $Δt$ | $-$ | $3$ | $4$ | $5$ | $3$ |\n| $C(t)$ | $-$ | $4$ | $3$ | $5$ | $2$ |\n\nWe plug in the numbers to approximate the area under the curve and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & ≈4\\cdot 3+3\\cdot 4+5\\cdot 5+2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =12+12+25+6 \\\\  & =55.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, in the given context, the area under the curve represents the total number of customers served over a period of $15$ minutes. So, the total number of customers is approximately\n$55.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [],
      "problem_field_keys": [],
      "answer_fields_complete": null,
      "result": "Correct",
      "proof_feedback": null,
      "html": "<div id=\"question-72064\" class=\"question\"><div class=\"questionHeader\"><span class=\"questionNumber\">56.</span><a class=\"questionKP\" href=\"/topics/1281#394\">Using the Right Riemann Sum With Irregular Step Size</a><span class=\"helpButton\" questionid=\"72064\">?</span></div><div class=\"questionText\"><p>The following table shows the number of customers per minute, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1663\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2C\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>,</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> that arrive at a bank, measured over a period of <mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1664\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container> minutes.</p>\n<table rules=\"all\" cellpadding=\"10\" align=\"center\" style=\"border:1px solid black; margin: auto; margin-bottom: 4mm; margin-top: 4mm\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <td width=\"40\" bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1665\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 0.278em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c69\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c6E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c75\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c74\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c65\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"0.278em\"></mspace></mstyle><mtext>(minutes)</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td width=\"40\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1666\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c30\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td width=\"40\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1667\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c33\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td width=\"40\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1668\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c37\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n  <td width=\"40\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1669\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c32\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n <td width=\"40\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1670\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mn class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c31\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c35\"></mjx-c></mjx-mn></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>15</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n  <td bgcolor=\"#D6EAF8\" style=\"text-align:center\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"1671\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D436 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D461 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"m